        "Title": "Ground Beef",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108234766528",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ba02f271-f256-41d7-97cc-c0a36e5db1e7).Image",
        "Description": "We have new information coming out of Bangkok,  Agent 47. \r\rFor years, the rich and lavish have frequented this five star establishment. As is customary, they have treated the assistance and accomodation the hotel provides with no regard.\r\rJordan Cross and his rowdy roadies were the last straw. \r\rMany members of the hotel staff are planning a revolt. \r\rWe, unfortunately, must quell this coup before it gets out of hand and disrupts our mission. \r\rGood Luck Agent 47.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
        "GameVersion": "8.25.0.0",
